7. Issuance of summons by respondent No.1 / II Class Executive Magistrate-cum-the Tahsildar is not a mechanical act and the learned II Class Executive Magistrate-cum-the Tahsildar is expected to act judiciously and take a conscious decision to issue summons, if there exists grounds to issue summons.
